<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's JSE renames its overall index.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's JSE renames its overall index.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange said on Wednesday that the name of its Actuaries Overall Index would be changed to the Actuaries All Share Index with effect from July 14.</p>
<p>It said the composition of the index remains unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
